        235.76
      ],
      "text": "Subject: Filling up the post of General Manager (Region), Food Corporation of India (DS/Director\nlevel), Regional Office, Panchkula, Haryana under the Department of Food and Public\nDistribution on deputation basis."
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 14,
      "poly": [
        37.48,
        245.02,
        79.14,
        245.02,
        79.14,
        256.81,
        37.48,
        256.81
      ],
      "text": "Sir/Madam,"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 15,
      "poly": [
        37.48,
        266.91,
        550.38,
        266.91,
        550.38,
        317.43,
        37.48,
        317.43
      ],
      "text": "This is regarding filling up of the post of General Manager (Region), Food Corporation of India\n(DS/Director level), Regional Office, Panchkula, Haryana under the Department of Food and Public\nDistribution on deputation basis. The above post is a Central Staffing Scheme post to be filled up through the\nCivil Services Board (CSB) procedure. This post has been identified as a sensitive post and therefore, the\ntenure of the post as per the extant guidelines of Central Vigilance Commission will be for a period of 3 years."
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 16,
      "poly": [
        37.48,
        328.38,
        550.38,
        328.38,
        550.38,
        384.79,
        37.48,
        384.79
      ],
      "text": "2. Officers of the rank of Deputy Secretary/Director level from the All India Services or any Organized\nServices of the Government of India (list enclosed), eligible for appointment under Central Staffing Scheme at\nDS/Director level are eligible for the above post. Further, having an experience of working with Food\nProcurement and Public Distribution System related matters may be treated as a desirable experience."
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 17,
      "poly": [
        37.48,
        391.53,
        550.38,
        391.53,
        550.38,
        515.3,
        37.48,
        515.3
      ],
      "text": "3. The above post may be circulated amongst officers eligible to be appointed at DS/Director or equivalent\nlevel in the Government of India under Central Staffing Scheme on priority basis. Names of willing and eligible\nofficers who can be spared by the State Governments/Ministries/Departments may be\nforwarded/emailed(dir.mm@nic.in) to the Department along with Cadre clearance, Vigilance clearance,\ndetailed bio-data (through SUPREMO link: https://supremo.nic.in). For officers working in the cadre, it\nmay also be ensured that the 'Cooling off' after a previous stint on deputation, if any, is completed and the\nofficer is eligible to be appointed on Central Deputation as per instructions. Applications of those eligible\nofficers who are already working on Central Deputation under the Central staffing Scheme/Non-CSS posts of\nGOI, are required to be forwarded by their respective Ministries/Department, along with the approval of their\nrespective Minister-in-Charge."
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 18,
      "poly": [
        37.48,
        521.2,
        550.38,
        521.2,
        550.38,
        600.35,
        37.48,
        600.35
      ],
      "text": "4. The last date for the submission of applications for the above-said post is 02.03.2026. Nominations are\nto be routed through DOPT online interface (DOPT website>>EO Division> Apply for posts of CSS, CVO and\nothers>>SUPREMO (Choose CSS category through SUPREMO link : https://supremo.nic.in) for those\nofficers who have not yet applied for any other posts online this year. Those officers who have already\napplied for CSS, CVO or Other posts in SUPREMO can send their willingness for the above post.\nNominations/correspondence on the subject may be routed through email id dir.mm@nic.in only."
    },
    {
